WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:07.330
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, for this week’s
Game of Thrones Video I’m going to talk

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:16.480
about the top 5 flashbacks I want the show
to do.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.410
Just to explain, Dan and Dave we doing an
interview recently and they owned up to the

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:23.279
fact season 5 would start with a flashback.

00:00:23.279 --> 00:00:30.369
Not necessarily the first scene of episode
1, but the first episode will have a flashback

00:00:30.369 --> 00:00:31.369
in it.

00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:34.160
I think it will probably be one of Bran’s
Godswood flashbacks, but they also said flashbacks

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:37.090
plural, as in multiple flashbacks during season
5.

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:49.750
So that opens it up a bit in terms of what
they can show.

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:53.490
While I was making this video, two new characters
were cast so I’ll explain who they are at

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:54.490
the end of the video.

00:00:54.490 --> 00:01:00.270
And heads up, this week is a special giveaway
for copies of World of Ice and Fire I’ll

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:04.250
also explain at the end.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:10.720
Careful for spoilers through season 4, here
are the top 5 flashbacks I want to see:

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:12.640
Number 5 - Bloodraven Flashback

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:16.250
This one isn’t as likely to happen but it
would be awesome to see the past from the

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.500
bloodraven’s perspective also known as the
three eyed rave.

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.890
He’s the one training Bran in the cave.

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:26.580
He was a big part of the first Blackfyre Rebellion
and eventually became a lord commander of

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:30.950
the Night’s Watch before completely embracing
his role as the last Greenseer where we see

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:31.950
him right now.

00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:34.740
That’s a lot of Westerosi history he’s
seen.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:39.550
If the show were to expand his part the show
could deal with some pre-show events in a

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:41.580
way that hasn’t been done in the novels.

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:47.299
But Bran is the main character, so of the
two of them, I think any Greensight flashbacks

00:01:47.299 --> 00:01:52.560
would probably come from him.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:55.070
Number 4 - White Walkers In Flashback

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:58.370
If they decide to go with a more traditional
flashback route, characters speaking about

00:01:58.370 --> 00:01:59.920
past events and showing them as if they were
memories.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:03.950
It would be awesome to get a look at any of
the notable events between the White Walkers

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.080
and the people of westeros.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:10.099
There are several moments in history including
the Long Night, The Night’s King, The Building

00:02:10.099 --> 00:02:14.270
of the Wall and their gradual re-emergence
before the events on the show.

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:18.790
When we first saw them in season 1, they had
already started replenishing their army.

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:22.050
The term flashback implies a great deal of
time though.

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:26.410
So if they do flashback to some white walker
related event, it would be before the younger

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:33.760
cast members were alive.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:37.860
It would be like an Old Nan story flashback.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:39.580
Most of her stories dealt with legends.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:03:01.300
Which may or may 
not be true.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:03.930
Number 3 - Doran Martell Flashback

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:12.480
This is pretty unlikely, but I do believe
there is a Dornish Master plan of sorts and

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:17.390
it would be fun for Doran to explain it as
we watch it begin and unfold.

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:21.540
For the most part, the Master Plan is a pseudo
revenge plot tied with an attempted coup.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:23.500
I’m sure you’ve all seen versions of theories
about it but a flashback would be a really

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:27.980
easy way for the show to cut through a lot
of the misconceptions and simplify everything.

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:34.350
Typically the show simplifies the book plot,
either by cutting stuff out or combining things.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:38.260
Alexander Siddig or Doctor Bashir, however
you want to think about him will probably

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:41.510
get an expanded part.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:48.010
In the books there are way more characters
so there’s less time to spend with him.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:52.640
But the show is changing a lot of the plot
so that they can spend more time with the

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:53.640
Martell characters in Dorne.

00:03:53.640 --> 00:04:01.239
I don’t want to get crazy with spoilers
or anything, but I posted a picture to facebook

00:04:01.239 --> 00:04:03.210
and twitter yesterday that pretty much explains
what’s going on.

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:13.130
So if you want to check it out I’l add a
link in the description.

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.580
Number 2 - Maggy The Frog

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:19.300
This is the name of a person and the name
of a prophecy related to Cersei.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:23.210
Maggy was a fortuneteller in Lannisport when
Jaime and Cersei were little kids.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:26.800
During a big tournament being held nearby
Cersei visited Maggy with two of her friends

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:28.610
to get their future’s read.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:32.030
Maggy gave Cersei some very ominous news.

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:37.930
It’s also believed that Cersei murdered
one of those friends because she wanted to

00:04:37.930 --> 00:04:40.320
get married to Jaime someday.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:48.060
It just adds a darker spin to Cersei’s character
and the murder part was only implied, it wasn’t

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:49.060
explicit.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:54.770
Right now in present day, Tywin Lannister
is dead and Varys has fled the city, so there’s

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:59.520
no one to tell Cersei what to do.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:01.639
She can rule as Queen regent without any interference.

00:05:01.639 --> 00:05:06.020
So she will get a lot more screentime.

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:12.820
The Maggy Prophecy and the event itself could
be used to give her behavoir in season 5 some

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:13.820
more context.

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:18.620
I spent a whole bonus video explaining the
Maggy the Frog Prophecy so I’ll include

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.530
a link in the description if you want to learn
more.

00:05:20.530 --> 00:05:27.889
But I would love for them to flashback to
a prophecy related moment.

00:05:27.889 --> 00:05:31.870
Number 1 - Ned Stark Winterfell Flashback

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:35.770
Bran is currently with the Three Eyed Raven
learning about Greensight.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:39.610
We got a little teaser for what that looks
like.

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:44.010
Like when touches the weirwood tree and has
visions of the Giant Weirwood with the cave.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:47.590
They might change the visual effect for it
to make it look a little cooler, but I think

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.449
that’s what the greensight scenes will look
like.

00:05:49.449 --> 00:05:50.490
They might drain some of the color out in
flashback moments.

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:55.210
Greensight is one of the more broad abilities
but the cool part is getting to see across

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:56.210
time.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:57.210
It’s localized to weirwood trees though.

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.210
So Bran and the Three eyed raven would only
be able to see historical events inside Godswoods

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.210
like the one in Winterfell.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.970
So there’s a small chance we could get a
Ned Stark flashback.

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:02.970
Regardless of who you think the most important
character is right now, I feel like Ned is

00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:06.190
a character that everyone can agree they want
to see again in some way.

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:13.289
I’ve seen most of you in the comments say
you’d like to see him as a wight.

00:06:13.289 --> 00:06:16.530
But I don’t think that will happen.

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:21.440
Ned spent a lot of time in the godswood at
winterfell, not just as an adult, but when

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.440
he was growing up.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.560
So Bran theoretically could see what he was
doing.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:30.070
Dan and Dan said there would be multiple flashbacks,
so they could do any number of moments.

00:06:30.070 --> 00:06:33.910
I do think it’s most likely they’ll use
Bran to do the flashbacks since it’s a part

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:34.910
of his abilities.

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.260
But there are a lot of fan favorite moments
like Robert’s Rebellion that people want

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:47.949
to see, so they could always deviate from
the books and show whatever they want.

00:06:47.949 --> 00:06:51.150
We do have little bit of info about that first
episode.

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:54.550
We know that Bran is in it for a little bit,
we don’t know what he’s doing, but if

00:06:54.550 --> 00:06:58.979
they’re doing a flashback in the first episode
and Bran has scenes.

00:06:58.979 --> 00:07:01.380
It’s possible they’ll open the season
with a Ned Stark moment.

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:02.490
That’s just a theory.

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:07.910
But let me know which flashbacks you want
to see.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:13.140
Just remember, it would probably involve characters
that have been featured on the show.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:18.729
And the other really big news is that they
just cast two more actors, Mr Eko from Lost

00:07:18.729 --> 00:07:20.270
is going to be a character named Malko.

00:07:20.270 --> 00:07:24.889
We don’t have any other details about him
but he’s not a character from the book.

00:07:24.889 --> 00:07:30.949
Based on his looks it’s possible he could
be featured in one of the eastern cities.

00:07:30.949 --> 00:07:36.020
There have been sets spotted for Illyrio’s
house in Pentos, Meereen of course because

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:38.310
Daenerys or he could show up in Dorne.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:41.040
Then other new person is Gwyenth Keyworth.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.750
She was on Misfits with Ramsay Bolton.

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:45.290
She won’t be a Bolton character though.

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:50.349
Her name in season 5 will be Clea and she’s
playing a Whore that Tyrion has some scenes

00:07:50.349 --> 00:07:51.349
with.

00:07:51.349 --> 00:07:55.956
As an actress she’s known for her foul mouth
and quick wit, but we dont’ really know

00:07:55.956 --> 00:07:56.956
where she’ll be meeting with tyrion.

00:07:56.956 --> 00:07:57.956
His boat with Varys was headed east, so probably
in Pentos or wherever the boat lands.

00:07:57.956 --> 00:07:58.956
Varys and Illyrio were conspiring together,
so it’s possible he could take Tyrion there

00:07:58.956 --> 00:07:59.956
first.

